und opening (x555-845,y788-822), thick white band, then inner opening (x575-825,y792-820) dark gradient. Currently rim ellipse + apron blend. We can replace whole sink block with clearer geometry.\n  - Add depth: inside basin gradient from dark top to lighter bottom with reflected window light (blue-grey vertical reflection). Add a drain and a thin stream of water? no. Add a sponge on rim, soap.\n  - The towel currently at left of sink front, fine. Make it hang from the front edge with a fold.\n\n- The eggs need clear oval silhouettes with pointier top; draw eggs vertical ovals (rx=16, ry=23) rather than horizontal circles, overlapping. Use cream colors #e8cda8 and speckles. Bowl rim fully visible; eggs inside, not covering entire top. Maybe 3 eggs: two upright, one tilted. At 740 crop it's clear.\n\n- Counter light patch looks nice around lemons.\n- Tiles too uniform; add variation.\n\nLet's open stove crop."}
